			<title>Noel Gallagher's favourite London's restaurant is Locanda Locatelli as well as Madonna's</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/74-noel-gallaghers-favourite-londons-restaurant-is-locanda-locatelli-as-well-as-madonnas.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/74-noel-gallaghers-favourite-londons-restaurant-is-locanda-locatelli-as-well-as-madonnas.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>Noel Gallagher</strong>, whose <strong>High Flying Birds</strong>' debut album is out next month, confessed to the <strong>Evening Standard Magazine</strong> that his favourite restaurant in <strong>London</strong> is Italian restaurant <strong>Locanda Locatelli</strong>, which is the one <strong>Madonna</strong> love the most.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>"There are Italian people in the kitchen, and there's the chance you might see <strong>Madonna</strong>," said <strong>Noel</strong>.</p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>London</li><ul></div>]]></description>
